cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software or findings in your research, please cite it as below."
title: "Cross-Modal Attention Fusion for Nepali Hate Speech Detection in Multimodal Memes"
abstract: "Official implementation of our CHiPSAL 2026 submission presenting a novel hybrid cross-modal attention fusion architecture with dynamic gating for detecting hate speech in Devanagari-scripted social media memes. Our system achieves 0.6834 F1-macro through selective fine-tuning of CLIP ViT-B/32 and BGE-M3 encoders with 4-head self-attention and learnable modality gating."
